  "worked_solution": "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 5 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((5)(0)-(3)(4))i-((1)(0)-(2)(4))j+((1)(3)-(2)(5))k \\\\  & =(0-12)i-(0-8)j+(3-10)k \\\\  & =-12i+8j-7k.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
